:math:`\sigma_i` will be rounded down to zero if :math:`\sigma_i \leq \text{rcond} \cdot \sigma_1`.
If :attr:`rcond`\ `= None` (default), :attr:`rcond` is set to the machine precision of the dtype of :attr:`A` times `max(m, n)`.

