                             precision of the dtype of :attr:`A` times `max(m, n)`. Default: `None`.

Keyword args:
    driver (str, optional): name of the LAPACK/MAGMA method to be used.
        If `None`, `'gelsy'` is used for CPU inputs and `'gels'` for CUDA inputs.
        Default: `None`.

